{"seq":3,"slug":"coldchain-sla-cost-carrier-kpi","title":"冷链 SLA/成本与承运商绩效（联121）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/perishable-coldchain-temperature-fulfillment/coldchain-waste-ops/coldchain-sla-cost-carrier-kpi","wordCount":2477,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"冷链-sla-成本与承运商绩效-联121\">冷链 SLA/成本与承运商绩效（联121）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>冷链的成本结构里有一个标品没有的乘数：<strong>&quot;温度合规&quot;不能打折</strong>。标品物流可以在时效与成本之间自由权衡——慢一点、便宜一点，客户能接受。冷链里时效与温度是耦合的：延长运输时间就意味着更长的温度维持负担、更高的能耗、更大的失效概率。降本的动作只要碰到这条耦合链，就会以报损的形式在另一处爆出来。</p>\n<p>因此冷链 SLA 的设计要点是<strong>把&quot;温度&quot;作为一等指标写进合同与考核</strong>，而不是只考核时效与完好率。只考核时效的承运商，会把货送到但温度坏了；只考核完好率的承运商，会因为&quot;外观完好&quot;而掩盖温度问题——生鲜的温度损伤往往在外观上不可见。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[承运商准入] --&gt; B[能力核验&lt;br/&gt;设备/资质/温控系统]&#10;  B --&gt; C[SLA 签约&lt;br/&gt;时效+温度+完好]&#10;  C --&gt; D[运营监控&lt;br/&gt;实时告警+交接记录]&#10;  D --&gt; E[月度绩效评分]&#10;  E --&gt; F{达标?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[增量份额/续约]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[整改期]&#10;  H --&gt; I{改善?}&#10;  I --&gt;|否| J[降份额/淘汰]&#10;  I --&gt;|是| G&#10;  E --&gt; K[成本复盘&lt;br/&gt;单位成本 vs 报损成本]&#10;  K --&gt; C\">graph TD\n  A[承运商准入] --&gt; B[能力核验&lt;br/&gt;设备/资质/温控系统]\n  B --&gt; C[SLA 签约&lt;br/&gt;时效+温度+完好]\n  C --&gt; D[运营监控&lt;br/&gt;实时告警+交接记录]\n  D --&gt; E[月度绩效评分]\n  E --&gt; F{达标?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[增量份额/续约]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[整改期]\n  H --&gt; I{改善?}\n  I --&gt;|否| J[降份额/淘汰]\n  I --&gt;|是| G\n  E --&gt; K[成本复盘&lt;br/&gt;单位成本 vs 报损成本]\n  K --&gt; C</pre><h2 id=\"冷链-sla-的指标设计\">冷链 SLA 的指标设计</h2><h3 id=\"三类指标必须并置\">三类指标必须并置</h3><p>冷链承运商考核至少要有三类指标，缺任何一类都会诱导错误行为：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>防止的作弊行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时效达成率</td>\n<td>在承诺时效窗内完成交付的比例</td>\n<td>慢速运输省钱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>温控合规率</td>\n<td>全程温度在允许区间内的批次比例</td>\n<td>送达但温度已坏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交接完整率</td>\n<td>每次交接都有合规的状态快照与温度证据</td>\n<td>责任推诿、无据可查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>温控合规率</strong>是冷链特有且最关键的一项，它的计算必须基于<strong>全程曲线</strong>而非单点抽查。单点抽查极易被规避——只要在抽查点前后把温度调回区间即可。</p>\n<p><strong>交接完整率</strong>看似是流程指标，实则是<strong>争议成本的直接抑制器</strong>。交接快照缺失意味着事故发生时无法切分责任（见 <a href=\"excursion-breach-liability-insurance\">断链定责与保险</a>），最终成本由货主自担。因此把它写成 SLA 指标，等于把&quot;证据完备&quot;外包给了承运商。</p>\n<h3 id=\"指标的两级判定\">指标的两级判定</h3><p>温控合规率不应是&quot;全有或全无&quot;。应当分两级：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>硬失败</strong>：出现不可逆温度阈值突破，或累计超温超出预算。判为不合格，触发赔付。</li>\n<li><strong>软偏差</strong>：未突破不可逆阈值但有超温记录。计为观察项，扣分但不赔付。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>分两级的意义是给承运商留下&quot;轻微偏差但货物无损&quot;的空间，避免他们为了&quot;零偏差&quot;而拒绝合理的中转作业（如必要的查验开箱）。判定用的累计暴露模型见 <a href=\"../temperature-monitoring-transit/iot-temperature-logger-excursion-alarm\">温控 IoT 与超温告警</a>。</p>\n<p>这套&quot;过程控制 + 记录留存&quot;的考核逻辑并非物流行业独创。食品安全侧的 HACCP 体系早就确立了同样的模式：识别关键控制点、设定关键限值、建立监控程序、并保留可复核的记录，FDA 在阐述该体系时明确指出，由于微生物检测太慢、无法用于实时控制，监控应优先采用时间与温度这类<strong>快速的物理与化学量测</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.fda.gov/food/hazard-analysis-critical-control-point-haccp/haccp-principles-application-guidelines\">FDA, HACCP Principles &amp; Application Guidelines</a>）。把它平移到承运商考核，意味着&quot;温控合规率&quot;就是承运商侧的 CCP，&quot;连续记录 + 交接快照&quot;就是它的监控记录——考核指标与合规体系其实共用同一套证据，这也是为什么本 hub 反复强调数据模型要一次设计到位。</p>\n<h3 id=\"sla-合同的关键条款\">SLA 合同的关键条款</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;sla_version&quot;: &quot;2026Q4-coldchain-v3&quot;,&#10;  &quot;carrier_id&quot;: &quot;CARR-3PL-0217&quot;,&#10;  &quot;zones_covered&quot;: [&quot;chilled&quot;, &quot;frozen&quot;],&#10;  &quot;targets&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;on_time_rate&quot;: 0.96,&#10;    &quot;temp_compliance_rate&quot;: 0.995,&#10;    &quot;handover_completeness&quot;: 0.999&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;breach_rules&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;hard_fail&quot;: { &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;temp_compliance_rate&quot;, &quot;threshold&quot;: 0.98, &quot;penalty&quot;: &quot;claim&quot; },&#10;    &quot;soft_deviation&quot;: { &quot;counts_against_score&quot;: true, &quot;penalty&quot;: &quot;none&quot; }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;evidence_requirements&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;continuous_logging&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;max_sample_gap_minutes&quot;: 15,&#10;    &quot;clock_sync_required&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;handover_snapshot_required&quot;: true&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;data_retention_days&quot;: 730&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sla_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026Q4-coldchain-v3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"carrier_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CARR-3PL-0217\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"zones_covered\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"chilled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"frozen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"targets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"on_time_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.96</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"temp_compliance_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.995</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"handover_completeness\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.999</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"breach_rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"hard_fail\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"temp_compliance_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"threshold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.98</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"penalty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"claim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"soft_deviation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"counts_against_score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"penalty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"none\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidence_requirements\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"continuous_logging\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"max_sample_gap_minutes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"clock_sync_required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"handover_snapshot_required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"data_retention_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">730</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>max_sample_gap_minutes</code> 与 <code>clock_sync_required</code> 是<strong>证据质量的门槛条款</strong>。没有它们，承运商可以提供一条采样稀疏或时钟漂移的记录，形式上&quot;有记录&quot;但实质上无法用于定责。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本结构与降本的正确顺序\">成本结构与降本的正确顺序</h2><h3 id=\"冷链成本的四块\">冷链成本的四块</h3><p>冷链履约成本大致由四块构成，它们的杠杆效应差别很大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本块</th>\n<th>占比量级</th>\n<th>降本杠杆</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>干线与干仓</td>\n<td>最大</td>\n<td>装载率、路径、回程配货</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仓储与预冷</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>周转率、能源管理、库位优化</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末端保温</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>箱体选型、时效窗分档、路线合并</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报损与理赔</td>\n<td>变动大</td>\n<td>温控水平、FEFO、定价</td>\n<td>高（降过头会爆）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>正确的降本顺序是<strong>从上往下</strong>：先优化装载率与路径（无质量风险），再优化周转与能源（低风险），再优化保温方案（需实测标定），最后才动温控标准（高风险）。反过来做——先砍温控标准省钱——会立刻在报损上还回来，且还回来的量通常更大。</p>\n<h3 id=\"单位成本口径\">单位成本口径</h3><p>冷链的单位成本必须用**&quot;每有效交付单位&quot;**而非&quot;每运输单位&quot;来算。原因在于两个折扣：温度不合格批次的成本应当剔除或单独归集，否则会摊薄到合格批次上，掩盖真实成本；退货与报损的返程成本也应计入对应批次。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>单位有效成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>总履约成本</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>不合格批次成本</mtext></mrow><mtext>合格交付量</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{单位有效成本} = \\frac{\\text{总履约成本} - \\text{不合格批次成本}}{\\text{合格交付量}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单位有效成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">合格交付量</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总履约成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不合格批次成本</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个口径让&quot;用更贵的承运商但报损更低&quot;这一类决策可以被正确比较——只有当单位有效成本的对比成立时，涨价才是合理的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"温度合规与成本的定量关系\">温度合规与成本的定量关系</h3><p>温控标准每收紧一档，成本是非线性上升的：需要更好的设备、更密的监控、更低的装载率（因为要留气流通道）。因此收紧标准要回答一个<strong>边际问题</strong>：多花的成本是否小于少报损的收益？</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta C*{temp} \\le \\Delta W*{avoided} \\cdot V\\_{unit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta C_{temp}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是收紧标准带来的增量成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta W_{avoided}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是预计减少的报损量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{unit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单位货值。这个不等式是判断&quot;要不要上更严的温控&quot;的唯一依据。它的难点在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta W_{avoided}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的估计——通常需要基于历史赔案与温度记录做回归，而不是靠经验判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"承运商绩效体系的落地\">承运商绩效体系的落地</h2><h3 id=\"评分卡与权重\">评分卡与权重</h3><p>一个可执行的评分卡把三类 SLA 指标与两项过程指标合成一个分数：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[原始数据] --&gt; B[时效达成率 权重30%]&#10;  A --&gt; C[温控合规率 权重35%]&#10;  A --&gt; D[交接完整率 权重15%]&#10;  A --&gt; E[异常响应时效 权重10%]&#10;  A --&gt; F[赔案配合度 权重10%]&#10;  B --&gt; G[加权总分]&#10;  C --&gt; G&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H{&gt;=85?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[A 级: 增量份额]&#10;  H --&gt;|70-85| J[B 级: 保持]&#10;  H --&gt;|&lt;70| K[C 级: 整改/降份额]\">flowchart TD\n  A[原始数据] --&gt; B[时效达成率 权重30%]\n  A --&gt; C[温控合规率 权重35%]\n  A --&gt; D[交接完整率 权重15%]\n  A --&gt; E[异常响应时效 权重10%]\n  A --&gt; F[赔案配合度 权重10%]\n  B --&gt; G[加权总分]\n  C --&gt; G\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H{&gt;=85?}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[A 级: 增量份额]\n  H --&gt;|70-85| J[B 级: 保持]\n  H --&gt;|&lt;70| K[C 级: 整改/降份额]</pre><p>权重设计上，<strong>温控合规率应占最高权重</strong>，因为它是冷链的核心价值；时效与交接次之。把时效设为最高权重是最常见的误配——它会让承运商在&quot;赶时效&quot;与&quot;保温度&quot;冲突时选择前者。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分级管理与份额分配\">分级管理与份额分配</h3><p>评分结果要落到<strong>份额分配</strong>上才有约束力。仅仅扣分而不影响业务量，承运商不会真正改变行为。常见的分级策略：A 级给增量与新线路优先权，B 级保持现有份额，C 级进入整改期并逐步降低份额。</p>\n<p>份额调整要有<strong>滞后与缓冲</strong>：生鲜的运力切换成本高（承运商需要时间准备冷链设备），频繁切换会造成服务波动。因此调整周期通常按月或按季，且给整改期。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据来源与可审计性\">数据来源与可审计性</h3><p>评分卡的可信度取决于数据来源。三类数据的归属不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时效数据</strong>：来自平台自身的订单与配送系统；</li>\n<li><strong>温度数据</strong>：来自承运商的记录仪或平台提供的设备；</li>\n<li><strong>交接数据</strong>：来自双方的交接单。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>当温度数据由被考核方提供时，存在<strong>数据可信度问题</strong>。解决方案有三种：使用平台自有的记录仪（成本高但最可信）、要求交接时双方共同读取并签字（成本中）、或对承运商数据做交叉校验（如用门状态与断电事件反推，成本低但覆盖有限）。选择哪种取决于该线路的货值与风险水平。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[平台系统] --&gt; D[评分引擎]&#10;  B[承运商记录仪] --&gt; C{交叉校验}&#10;  C --&gt;|一致| D&#10;  C --&gt;|不一致| E[人工复核]&#10;  E --&gt; D&#10;  F[双方交接单] --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; G[月度评分表]&#10;  G --&gt; H[份额决策]&#10;  G --&gt; I[条款复盘]\">graph LR\n  A[平台系统] --&gt; D[评分引擎]\n  B[承运商记录仪] --&gt; C{交叉校验}\n  C --&gt;|一致| D\n  C --&gt;|不一致| E[人工复核]\n  E --&gt; D\n  F[双方交接单] --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; G[月度评分表]\n  G --&gt; H[份额决策]\n  G --&gt; I[条款复盘]</pre><h3 id=\"复盘的闭环\">复盘的闭环</h3><p>评分不是为了排名，而是为了修正。每次月度复盘应产出三类结论：<strong>条款是否需要调整</strong>（阈值设得太松或太紧）、<strong>线路是否需要重新设计</strong>（某线路反复超温可能是线路本身的问题，而非承运商）、<strong>是否需要引入第二供应商</strong>（单点依赖本身就是风险）。</p>\n<p>其中&quot;线路本身的问题&quot;值得特别强调：当同一条线路的所有承运商都表现不佳时，根因通常不在承运商，而在线路设计——比如中转点缺乏冷藏条件、或时效窗本身不可达。这类问题的解法在 <a href=\"../temperature-monitoring-transit/reefer-container-linehaul-handoff\">口岸衔接</a> 与 <a href=\"../cold-customs-lastmile/local-cold-warehouse-turnover\">本地冷库周转</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>冷链里时效与温度<strong>耦合</strong>，降本动作碰到这条耦合链会以报损形式在别处爆出，因此温度必须是一等 SLA 指标。</li>\n<li>三类必备指标：时效达成率、<strong>温控合规率</strong>（基于全程曲线，权重最高）、交接完整率（抑制争议成本）。</li>\n<li>温控合规率应有**硬失败（不可逆阈值/超预算，触发赔付）与软偏差（有超温但无损，扣分不赔付）**两级。</li>\n<li>SLA 合同必须包含证据质量门槛条款：最大采样间隔、时钟同步、交接快照、数据保留期。</li>\n<li>降本顺序从上往下：装载率/路径 → 周转/能源 → 保温方案 → 最后才动温控标准。</li>\n<li>单位成本用&quot;<strong>每有效交付单位</strong>&quot;口径，剔除不合格批次，才能正确比较不同承运商。</li>\n<li>收紧温控的判据是不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta C_{temp} \\le \\Delta W_{avoided} \\cdot V_{unit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 需由历史赔案与温度记录估计。</li>\n<li>评分结果必须落到<strong>份额分配</strong>并有滞后缓冲；对承运商自报温度数据要设计可信度方案。</li>\n<li>同线路所有承运商都差时，根因通常在<strong>线路设计</strong>而非承运商。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"冷链 SLA/成本与承运商绩效（联121）","id":"冷链-sla-成本与承运商绩效-联121"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"冷链 SLA 的指标设计","id":"冷链-sla-的指标设计"},{"level":3,"text":"三类指标必须并置","id":"三类指标必须并置"},{"level":3,"text":"指标的两级判定","id":"指标的两级判定"},{"level":3,"text":"SLA 合同的关键条款","id":"sla-合同的关键条款"},{"level":2,"text":"成本结构与降本的正确顺序","id":"成本结构与降本的正确顺序"},{"level":3,"text":"冷链成本的四块","id":"冷链成本的四块"},{"level":3,"text":"单位成本口径","id":"单位成本口径"},{"level":3,"text":"温度合规与成本的定量关系","id":"温度合规与成本的定量关系"},{"level":2,"text":"承运商绩效体系的落地","id":"承运商绩效体系的落地"},{"level":3,"text":"评分卡与权重","id":"评分卡与权重"},{"level":3,"text":"分级管理与份额分配","id":"分级管理与份额分配"},{"level":3,"text":"数据来源与可审计性","id":"数据来源与可审计性"},{"level":3,"text":"复盘的闭环","id":"复盘的闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"损耗报损率与鲜度库存定价（联167）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/perishable-coldchain-temperature-fulfillment/coldchain-waste-ops/spoilage-rate-fresh-pricing"},"next":null}